OL,3,GNEWSABrighton coaching clinics a
OL,4,A'watershed' for baseball
OL,5,
OL,6,FBaseball coaching clinics held in
OL,7,FBrighton by a British Major League
OL,8,FBaseball (MLB) star have been described
OL,9,Fas being part of a "watershed moment'
OL,10,Ffor the sport in the UK.
OL,12,FHarry Ford plays for the Washington
OL,13,FNationals and helped GB reach their
OL,14,Ffirst ever World Baseball Classic in
OL,15,F2023 ` the sport's biggest
OL,16,Finternational competition.
OL,18,FThe invite-only coaching clinics he
OL,19,Fheld for young talent recently were the
OL,20,Ffirst from a MLB player on UK soil.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
