OL,3,GNEWSABrighton coaching clinics a
OL,4,A'watershed' for baseball
OL,5,
OL,6,FFord's clinics are part of Great
OL,7,FBritain Baseball's (GBB) efforts to
OL,8,Fbridge the gap between players who used
OL,9,Fthe elite pathways to develop in the US
OL,10,Fand talent based in the UK.
